# Scenario name
msgid "Iris Siege"
msgstr "Iris Siege"

# Scenario description
msgid ""
"The system holds destructive nebulae at bay but enemies sabotage our "
"defensive apparatus. Stop them before the system is overwhelmed.\n"
"\n"
"Designed for one or more player ships. Terrain changes each time the "
"scenario is run. Scenario inspired by aspects of a scenario written by "
"srps.\n"
"\n"
"Version 1\n"
"\n"
"USN Discord: https://discord.gg/PntGG3a where you can join a game online. "
"There's usually one every weekend. All experience levels are welcome."
msgstr "The system holds destructive nebulae at bay but enemies sabotage our defensive apparatus. Stop them before the system is overwhelmed.\n\nDesigned for one or more player ships. Terrain changes each time the scenario is run. Scenario inspired by aspects of a scenario written by srps.\n\nVersion 1\n\nUSN Discord: https://discord.gg/PntGG3a where you can join a game online. There's usually one every weekend. All experience levels are welcome."

